---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { contact } from '../config/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy · The Vine Marketing" description="How The Vine Marketing collects and uses the details you send us, under POPIA.">
  <section class="page-head" aria-labelledby="t">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1 id="t">Privacy notice.</h1>
    <p class="lede">The Vine Marketing (Pty) Ltd, Rustenburg, South Africa, respects your privacy and handles personal information in line with the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA).</p>
  </section>
  <section class="block prose" aria-label="Privacy notice">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you use our enquiry form or the Free 5-Point Lead Response Test form, or message us on WhatsApp or email, we collect what you give us: your name, business name, phone or WhatsApp number, email address and your message. We also record when you contact us and which form you used.</p>
    <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
    <p>We use your details to reply to your enquiry, carry out the test or service you asked for, and follow up about that request. We do not sell your information.</p>
    <h2>Who handles it</h2>
    <p>Your details are stored in our customer-management platform (VanX Funnels, built on GoHighLevel) and in our email and WhatsApp accounts. These providers process information on our behalf. Our website is hosted on GitHub Pages.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep enquiry details for as long as needed to deal with your request and for our normal business records. You can ask us to delete them sooner.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may ask to see the information we hold about you, correct it, or have it deleted, and you may object to us contacting you. You may also complain to the Information Regulator at inforeg.org.za.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>We do not run advertising trackers on this site. It stores your light or dark theme choice in your own browser. The enquiry form is provided by VanX and may set the cookies it needs to work.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions or requests: <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>. Information Officer: Lourence Erasmus.</p>
    <p class="soft">Last updated 10 November 2026.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
